[Lem 17 of arXiv:2609.02879, 'On the cut locus of Hamilton--Jacobi equations I: structure and propagation via the touchi'] Let $\phi\in\text{\rm SCL}\,(\T^n)$. Then
	\begin{align*}
		\reg(\phi)=\{x\in\T^n:D\phi(x) \text{ exists and } \exists\ \lambda_x\geqslant0\ \text{s.t.}\ |p-D\phi(x)|\leqslant\lambda_x\cdot  d(y,x),\forall y\in\T^n, p\in D^+\phi(y)\}.
	\end{align*}

