[Lemma LEM:CT of arXiv:2512.23957, 'Concentration and fluctuations of sine-Gordon measure around topological multi-soliton man'] Under $\min_{\ell \neq i} |\xi_\ell -\xi_i| \ge d_\varepsilon=|\log(\varepsilon \log \frac 1\varepsilon)|$, we have 
\begin{align*}
\big\| \big(G^D_{ \text{OU}, \xi_1,\dots,\xi_k} W_j G^D_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k} \big) - \big( G^D_{\xi_1,\dots,\xi_k}  W_j  G^D_{ \text{OU}, \xi_1,\dots,\xi_k} \big)   \big\|_{L^2 \to L^2} \lesssim e^{-c \min_{\ell \neq i} |\xi_\ell -\xi_i|  } \to 0, 
\end{align*}

\noindent
as $\varepsilon \to 0$, where $W_j=\textup{sech}^2(\cdot-\xi_j)$.

