[Definition 12 (Belief propagation operator) of arXiv:2606.21699, 'Exact reconstruction thresholds on hypertrees over a symmetric binary alphabet'] Consider the model $\BOHT(D,r,\cX,\pi,B)$.
  The belief propagation (BP) operator $\BP$ maps a channel $P$ with input alphabet $\cX$ to
  \begin{align}
    \BP(P) = \bE_{b\sim D} \left(P^{\times (r-1)} \circ B\right)^{\star b}.
