[Lemma 40 (Eigenfunctions of the Ornstein--Uhlenbeck generator in $\R^N$) of arXiv:2605.14630, '2605.14630'] For $k\in\H=\R^N$ let
\begin{equation}
 f(x) = \Phi_k = \prod_{i=1}^N H_{k_i}(x_i)\;.
\end{equation} 
Then 
\begin{equation}

 -\pscal{\nabla f(x)}{x} + \Delta f(x) = -\abs{k} f(x)\;.
