[Lem lemma:approx of arXiv:2607.09841, 'Mixing and cutoff for the systematic scan dynamics of the mean-field ferromagnetic Potts m'] Let $\hat \gamma_n = 1 - b/n$. Then, $|\gamma_n - \hat \gamma_n| = O(n^{-2})$ and for every $t \in [0, \dots, n\sqrt n]$,
\begin{align}
    \frac{e^{-bt/n}}{2} \leq\gamma_n^t \leq 2 e^{-bt/n} .
\end{align}

