[Lemma lem:stability-region of arXiv:2607.23381, '\textbf{Non-Gaussianity of the Stagnation Law \\ in Particle Swarm Optimization}\\[0.35em]'] For $-1<w<1$ and $c>0$, one has $\rho(T_2)<1$ if and only if $D_2(w,c)>0$.  In particular,
