[Lemma le:nthchaos of arXiv:2411.09058, 'Time-dependent averages of a critical long-range stochastic heat equation'] For any $n\geq 1$, $R>0$, setting  $\eta_0=0$, we have
\begin{equation*}
   \mathbb Var[I_1^{(n)} (\1_{B_R})]=\kappa^{2n}(2\pi)^{d} R^{2d-2n}
     c_{d}^n \int_{\mathbb R^{nd}} \prod_{j=1}^n \|\eta_j-\eta_{j-1}\|^{-d+2} \|\eta_n\|^{-d}J_{d/2}(\|\eta_n\|)^2\varphi(\bm{\eta}_n/R)  \mathrm{d} \bm{\eta}_n,\end{equation*}
