[Lemma 7 of arXiv:2603.28170, 'Stabilization time of finite configurations with a second class particle in discrete TASEP'] \begin{enumerate}
\item
In the symmetric case $p=1/2$, we have that
\begin{align}
\P_2\left(V_1<m\bigm|V_0>m\right)&\to\frac12\\
