[Lemma 80 of arXiv:2510.27589, 'Geodesic switches and exceptional times in dynamical Brownian last passage percolation'] Fix $\delta>0$. For all $m\geq n^{100\delta}$, all $\alpha \leq n^{\delta/2}m^{1/3}$, we have the following.
  \begin{equation}

    \PP(\nearmax^{\alpha}(\frakf_{n^\delta}^m)\geq n^{8\delta})\leq Ce^{-cn^{8\delta}}
  \end{equation}

