[Lemma lem:FirstMoment of arXiv:2410.23915, 'Asymptotic Bounds and Online Algorithms for Average-Case Matrix Discrepancy'] The first moment of $S_n(\varepsilon)$ is given by
        \begin{equation*}
            \E S_n(\varepsilon) = 2^n \P{\left\lVert\ifblank{X}{\:\cdot\:}{X}\right\rVert \leq \frac{\varepsilon}{\sqrt{n}}},
        \end{equation*}
        where $X \sim \mathrm{GOE}(m)$.

