\leq C_0 \mathcal{E}_{Q}^{\#} ,
\end{align*}
where $C_0$ depends only on $d,M,\varrho,\nu,\nu_0,r$ and $\alpha$ and $\mathcal{E}_Q^{\#}$ is as in (equation eq:def_En_Q_caccioppoli of the paper).

