As in (equation eq:s of the paper), we write
\[
    {\zeta} \coloneqq 100\log \log n
    \qquad {M} \coloneqq \left\lfloor\frac{\log  n}{10{\zeta}}\right\rfloor,
    \qquad{\lambda} \coloneqq (\log n)^{1/4}.
