[Prop 16 of arXiv:2607.27932, '2607.27932'] For any $\varepsilon\in(0,\varepsilon_c)$, arbitrary $H>0$ and for any $\kappa>0$ small enough, there exist a rank
		$N_{\varepsilon,\kappa}\ge 1$ and a positive finite time $T_{\varepsilon,\kappa}$, both independent of $\sigma$, such that, for any $N\ge
