body:
[Lemma 8 of arXiv:2608.21255, 'Laws of the iterated logarithm for random Dirichlet series with general weights'] The following asymptotic relations hold:
\begin{equation}
    \sum_{j=1}^n 4^j\exp(-\eee^{j^2-n^2})~\sim~\Big(\frac{1}{\eee}+\frac{1}{3}\Big)4^n,~~n\to\infty
\end{equation}
and
\begin{equation}
\sum_{j\ge n+1} 4^j\exp(-\eee^{j^2-n^2})~\sim~ 4^{n+1}\exp(-\eee^{2n+1}),~~n\to\infty.
\end{equation}

