[Proposition 7 of arXiv:2606.30411, 'Notes on constants for maxima of Rademacher averages'] Let \(G_1,\ldots,G_p\) ($p\in\Nb$) be independent standard normal random variables. Then
\begin{equation*}
    \inf_{p\geq 1}\frac{\Eb \max_{1\leq j\leq p}|G_j|}{\sqrt{\log(2p)}} = \sqrt{\frac{2}{\pi\log 2}}.
\end{equation*}

