[Lemma 18 of arXiv:2609.01114, 'Unbalanced spectral Tur\'an problem for color-critical graphs with prescribed large maximu'] We have
	\begin{equation*}
		\rho(S_{n,\Delta,p})
		\ge
		\frac12\left(
		\frac{p-1}{p}\Delta+
