[Definition 16 of arXiv:2608.29086, '2608.29086'] [Interaction between molecules]
Given $M \subset M_0$ and $\psi_1, \psi_2 \in MOL(M)$. $\psi_1$ and $\psi_2$ \textit{interact} if $\exists \psi_3 \in MOL(M)$ such that
\begin{equation*}
|\psi_3|=|\psi_1| \cup |\psi_2| \quad  \subset \mathbf{R}^2.
\end{equation*}

