    \alpha_{A_1\times A_2}(B_t^{x,x},\overline{B}_s^{y,y}) = \lim_{\epsilon\to0} \alpha^\epsilon_{A_1\times A_2}(B_t^{x,x},\overline{B}_s^{y,y}) \qquad \text{in probability}
