[Proposition marginal_of_coupling of arXiv:2608.13716, 'Graph Causal Optimal Transport \ and Wasserstein Distances'] Let $G = (V, E)$ be a sorted DAG. Suppose $A \subseteq V$ is such that $\mathrm{pa}_{i} \subseteq A$ for all $i \in A$. Let $\mu \in \Gprobabilities{\mathcal{X}}$, $
