[Lemma lem:sec-mom-summable of arXiv:2608.30829, 'Free energy and phase transition for\\ 2D directed polymers with critical spatial correlat'] Suppose that Assumption~(main-assumption of the paper) holds with summable correlations~(equation finite-sum of the paper), and let $(\beta_N)_{N \ge 0}$ be as in~(equation def:beta-N-summable of the paper) from Assumption~(hyp:scaling of the paper). 
