u > 0$ and
  $x_{1} \in \hcV^{(m i)}_{
u}$ we have
   egin{equation*}
    \sum_{\substack{x_{2} \in \hcV^{(m i)}_{
u}\x_{2} 
eq x_{1}}} \left<   1_{\Sdu(x_{1})},   1_{\Sdu(x_{2})} ight> \leq 2
u  rac{\log N}{\log\log N}
