[Lemma lem:psi_lb of arXiv:2412.05491, 'Near-critical and finite-size scaling for \\ high-dimensional lattice trees and animals'] Let $d >8$, $L \ge L_0$,
and $c_3=\frac {16}{81} c_0^4$,
where $c_0$ is the constant of Lemma~(lem:Glb of the paper).
Then
\begin{equation}
\psi_p(x) \gtrsim   \frac{1}{m(p)^2r^d}
\end{equation}
for all $r\ge 2L+1$, all $p \in [p_c - c_3 r^{-4}, p_c)$, and all $x\in \mathbb{T}_r^d$.

