[Lemma 85 (Factorial alternating estimate under a trace clock) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] For every $q\ge2$ there is $C_q<\infty$, independent of $k,s,t$, the
dimension of $E$, and the clock, such that
