[Lemma 15 (Eigenfunctions of $L_C$) of arXiv:2609.03647, 'Extension Problems for the Vladimirov--Taibleson Operator and the Hierarchical Laplacian'] For any ball $B\in\mathcal{B}$, define the piecewise constant
    function
    \begin{align*}
        f_B(x)=
        \begin{cases}
            \dfrac{1}{m(B)}-\dfrac{1}{m(B')},&x\in B,\\
            -\dfrac{1}{m(B')},&x\in B'\setminus B,\\
            0,&x\notin B'.
        \end{cases}
    \end{align*}
    Then
    \begin{align*}
        L_Cf_B(x)=\lambda(B')f_B(x),
        \qquad x\in X.
    \end{align*}

