where $0<\mu<\overline{\mu}= rac{1}{2}\min \{2\mu_2,
u+1,2\overline{\gamma},\overline{\gamma}+\mu_1\}$ with $ ar\gamma = \min\{{\alpha}_1, \alpha_2, \alpha_3, \gamma_1, \gamma_2\}$, $ eta={\sqrt{L_{b }}+p^{ rac{1}{\overline{
