Writing $y_{j,a}:=U_m(y_j,a_j)$, define
\begin{equation}
\Phi_I^{(m)}(\theta):=\bigl(q_{y_j,y_{j,a}}^{(m)}(\theta)\bigr)_{j=1}^s\in\RR^s.
