[Lemma appendix-lm.1 of arXiv:2602.04303, '\Large\textbf{Strong solutions to SDEs with singular drifts driven by fractional Brownian '] For $0<\beta\leq1,0<y<x<\infty$, it holds that
				\begin{equation}
					\frac{|y^{\alpha}-x^{\alpha}|}{(x-y)^\beta}\lesssim\left\{\begin{array}{l}
						y^{\alpha-\beta},\qquad \alpha<0;\\
						x^{\alpha-\beta},\qquad \alpha\geq0.
