[Proposition 58 of arXiv:2511.09517, 'From Cannings model to Brownian motion conditioned on local time profile'] Assume \eqref{H1} and \eqref{eq:3rd}. Then for every $k\ge 1$,
  \begin{align}
      \big(\widetilde{\mathscr{T}}^n_k,\{\widetilde{V}^n_i\}_{1\le i\le k}\big)\overset{d}{\longrightarrow} \big(\mathcal{T}_k^{\ell,\sigma},\{L_i\}_{1\le i\le k}\big)\text{ under the distance \eqref{fidis}}.
