[Lemma 16 (Green's first identity for the truncated tree $\mathcal{T}_{p^n}^{R}$) of arXiv:2609.03647, 'Extension Problems for the Vladimirov--Taibleson Operator and the Hierarchical Laplacian'] Let $g,h\in\mathbb{R}^{\mathcal{T}_{p^n}}$ satisfy
$\mathcal{E}[g]<+\infty$, $\mathcal{E}[h]<+\infty$, and
$g_R\in L^2(\mathbb{Q}_p^n)$. Then
\begin{align*}
\frac{1}{2}\sum_{\substack{u,v\in\mathcal{T}_{p^n}^{R}\\u\sim v}}
(g(u)-g(v))(h(u)-h(v))w_{uv}=-\sum_{u\in\mathcal{T}_{p^n}^{R}}g(u)\Delta_wh(u)
-\sum_{u\in\partial\mathcal{T}_{p^n}^{R}}g(u)
\sum_{\substack{v\notin\mathcal{T}_{p^n}^{R}\\v\sim u}}
(h(u)-h(v))w_{uv}.
\end{align*}

