\[
a_n = \mathbb{P}(S_n >0) = \frac12(1 - \mathbb{P}(S_n=0)) = \frac12(1-h_n),
\]
which yields a relation for the generating functions. For $|s|<1$ we ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:28f992ffa4fc03f14630d3af29e4cc2d96228e628c7e99a43816f7b77e350265","revision_digest":"sha256:b86443b327e4de4c0085b4913492700e12e974b45855b12d40400447aaebe503","source_id":"arxiv:2605.00997","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

