 \mssd_{\U}^{(r)}(\gamma, \eta):= \inf_{\alpha, \beta \in \U(\partial B_r)}\mssd_{\U(\bar{B}_r)}(\gamma_{B_r}+\alpha, \eta_{B_r}+\beta) \qquad  \gamma, \eta \in \U \fstop

