[Lemma 57 (Two-sided block assembly) of arXiv:2606.29292, 'Intrinsic Gaussian Tensor Geometry and Random Operator Spectra'] Let $1\le r\le\infty$ and put
\[
 s_r:=\min\{r,2\},
 \qquad s_\infty:=2.
\]
For every finite array $(A_{\lambda,\mu})$ with the preceding block
supports,
\begin{equation}

 \norm{\sum_{\lambda,\mu}A_{\lambda,\mu}}_{\Sch_r}
 \le
 \left(\sum_{\lambda,\mu}
       \norm{A_{\lambda,\mu}}_{\Sch_r}^{s_r}
 \right)^{1/s_r}.
\end{equation}
At $r=2$ equality holds.

