    Multiplying on the left by $\sigX^{-1}$ gives (equation eq:inv_sig_dyn of the","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:f1f07be4859a77c40931acb6d683abdeb0f843b5a8f94943f80f582411bd771c","revision_digest":"sha256:bbc70b224c681ff36bca94bed0c8314769fed374f9e23763ffa86ed10b495e94","source_id":"arxiv:2604.22528","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-07","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

