body:
[Lemma appendix-lm.2 of arXiv:2602.04303, '\Large\textbf{Strong solutions to SDEs with singular drifts driven by fractional Brownian '] For $0<s<t,\beta>0,0<\gamma\leq\min\{\beta,1\},\gamma<\alpha+1$, it holds that
				\begin{equation}
					\int_s^tr^{-\beta}(t-r)^\alpha\mathrm{d} r\lesssim \left\{\begin{array}{ll}
						s^{-\beta+\gamma}(t-s)^{\alpha+1-\gamma},\qquad&\alpha<0;\\
						s^{-\beta+\gamma}(t-s)^{\alpha+1-\gamma-\varepsilon},\qquad&\alpha\geq0,
					\end{array}\right.
				\end{equation}
				where $\varepsilon>0$ can be arbitrarily small.

metadata_json:
{"artifact_digest":"sha256:b2c657ef1747fcd52e335ea5bc52dd5d80ee3ade433abe572178df9be669e157","artifact_path":"objects/sha256/b2/b2c657ef1747fcd52e335ea5bc52dd5d80ee3ade433abe572178df9be669e157.md","bundle_digest":"sha256:94bb51daa2010f3139cd4c1c02463bbb73844744bb34c4e37f0edcb864fc9f61","bundle_entry_key":"2602-04303-lemma-26-appendix-lm-2","bundle_id":"population.tex-extract-s0_045","claim_kind":"lemma","conditions":[],"domain":"probability theory","draft":"tex-extract-v2-20260907/bundle_s0_045.json","evidence_ids":[],"logical_id":"math:harvest.arxiv.mathematics:arxiv-2602-04303-lemma-26-appendix-lm-2","overlay_schema_version":1,"proof_text":"Paper's own proof, opening: \textbf{Case 1}: $\alpha<0$. Then, the condition $0<\gamma\leq\min\{\beta,1\},\gamma<\alpha+1$ reduces to $0<\gamma\leq\beta,\gamma<\alpha+1$. As a consequence,
				\begin{align*}
					\int_s^tr^{-\beta}(t-r)^\alpha\mathrm{d} r&\leq s^{-\beta+\gamma}\int_s^tr^{-\gamma}(t-r)^\alpha\mathrm{d} r\\
					&\leq s^{-\beta+\gamma}\sum_{n=1}^\infty\int_{r_n}^{r_{n-1}}r^{-\gamma}(r_{n-1}-r)^\alpha\mathrm{d} r.
				\end{align*}
				where $r_n=s+(t-s)2^{-n}$ and we use the fact that $t-r>r_{n-1}-r,\alpha<0$ in the second inequality. Note that $r_n>(t-s)2^{-n}=r_{n-1}-r_n$. Thus, we complete the proof for case 1 due to the fact that ...","release_manifest_digest":"sha256:7fce67ba16ab013938af8707177357c18ac2ebc84a737bd67cdff0c3f6753db0","revision_digest":"sha256:bd88b513002ffba9f112f1d550f40f3bc8d5b2e051012433e64207d55fa013cb","source_id":"arxiv:2602.04303","source_revision":"tex-as-downloaded-2026-09-08","statement_fidelity_reviewed":false,"supersedes":[],"trust_class":"curated_secondary","truth_status":"unverified"}

