Under \cref{ass:gp-true,ass:gp-eigenvalues},
    \begin{align}
    \E[\KL(Q_t^{(J)}\|\Pi_t)|X_{1:t}]&\lesssim t
    \end{align}
for any given covariates $X_{1:t}:=(X_1,\dots, X_t)$.

