[Lem 14 of arXiv:2608.20552, 'One-point fluctuations for exponential last passage percolation under upper-tail condition'] Let $C>0$. Then
\begin{equation}

\sum_{n_1,n_2\in\N}
\frac{C^{n_1+n_2}}
{(n_1!n_2!)^{3/2}}
\sum_{0\leq a,b\leq n_1\wedge n_2}
a!b!\sqrt{(n_1+n_2-a-b)!}
<\infty.
\end{equation}

