  and assume that the remaining conditions in Theorem \ref{th:1} hold, then there exists a unique global solution to \eqref{e:de-solution} with the following property
\begin{equation*}
  \E \left[\Vert u(t,\cdot)\Vert_2^2\right]<\infty,
