[Lemma eq: normsq of J_1 of arXiv:2609.02073, 'Existence of closed non-planar $p$-elasticae'] The vector field
\begin{equation*}
  J_1 = J_0 - \frac{1}{p C} |J_0|^2 k^{p-1} B,
\end{equation*}
with 
\begin{equation}

  |J_1|^2 = \left\langle J_0 - \frac{1}{p C} |J_0|^2 k^{p-1} B, J_0 - \frac{1}{p C} |J_0|^2 k^{p-1} B \right\rangle  = \frac{|J_0|^2 }{p^2C^2} (|J_0|^2 k^{2p-2}-p^2C^2).
\end{equation} 
is a pure rotation along the axis $\frac{J_0}{|J_0|}$.

